<div class="container">
    <header>
        <button class="lang-switch" onclick="toggleLanguage()" id="lang-btn">🌐 Español</button>
        <h1 id="app-title">Ekuazioen Simuladorea - DBH 1</h1>
        <p id="app-subtitle">Teoria, simuladore interaktiboak eta grafikoak - DBH 1</p>
    </header>

    <nav class="tabs">
        <button class="tab-btn active" onclick="openTab(event, 'intro')" id="tab-intro-btn">Zer da ekuazio bat?</button>
        <button class="tab-btn" onclick="openTab(event, 'deg1')" id="tab-deg1-btn">1. mailakoak</button>
        <button class="tab-btn" onclick="openTab(event, 'deg2')" id="tab-deg2-btn">2. mailakoak</button>
        <button class="tab-btn" onclick="openTab(event, 'practice')" id="tab-prac-btn">Ariketa Praktikoak</button>
    </nav>

    <!-- INTRODUCCIÓN TEÓRICA CON BALANZA SVG -->
    <div id="intro" class="tab-content active">
        <h2 id="intro-title">Zer da ekuazio bat?</h2>
        
        <div class="step-card">
            <strong id="intro-sec1-title">1. Berdintza Matematikoa eta Balantza:</strong>
            <p id="intro-sec1-desc">Ekuazio bat bi adierazpen algebriko lotzen dituen <strong>berdintza bat</strong> da. Balantza bat orekan bezala pentsa daiteke: ezkerraldean dagoenak eta eskuinaldean dagoenak balio bera dute.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- REPRESENTACIÓN GRÁFICA INTERACTIVA DE LA BALANZA -->
        <div class="balance-svg-box">
            <svg width="380" height="180" viewBox="0 0 380 180">
                <!-- Base de la balanza -->
                <polygon points="190,140 170,170 210,170" fill="#4a5568" />
                <rect x="186" y="70" width="8" height="70" fill="#718096" />

                <!-- Barra horizontal de la balanza en equilibrio -->
                <line x1="50" y1="70" x2="330" y2="70" stroke="#2b6cb0" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" />

                <!-- Platos de la balanza -->
                <!-- Izquierda (Plato L) -->
                <line x1="80" y1="70" x2="80" y2="110" stroke="#a0aec0" stroke-width="2" />
                <path d="M 40,110 Q 80,125 120,110 Z" fill="#319795" />
                <!-- Contenido Izquierda: Caja X + 3kg -->
                <rect x="52" y="85" width="24" height="24" fill="#d69e2e" rx="3" />
                <text x="64" y="102" font-size="14" font-weight="bold" fill="white" text-anchor="middle">x</text>
                <circle cx="95" cy="100" r="8" fill="#e2e8f0" stroke="#4a5568" stroke-width="1.5" />
                <text x="95" y="104" font-size="10" font-weight="bold" fill="#2d3748" text-anchor="middle">3kg</text>

                <!-- Derecha (Plato R) -->
                <line x1="300" y1="70" x2="300" y2="110" stroke="#a0aec0" stroke-width="2" />
                <path d="M 260,110 Q 300,125 340,110 Z" fill="#319795" />
                <!-- Contenido Derecha: Pesa 7kg -->
                <circle cx="300" cy="98" r="12" fill="#e2e8f0" stroke="#4a5568" stroke-width="1.5" />
                <text x="300" y="103" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" fill="#2d3748" text-anchor="middle">7kg</text>

                <!-- Explicación gráfica -->
                <text x="190" y="25" font-size="15" font-weight="bold" fill="#2b6cb0" text-anchor="middle">x + 3 = 7  ➔  x = 4</text>
            </svg>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card">
            <strong id="intro-sec2-title">2. Ezezaguna ("x"):</strong>
            <p id="intro-sec2-desc">Ekuazio batean, ezagutzen ez dugun balio bati <strong>ezezaguna</strong> deitzen diogu, eta "x" letrerekin adierazten dugu. Ekuazioa ebaztea berdintza egiazko egiten duen "x"-ren balioa aurkitzea da.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card">
            <strong id="intro-sec3-title">3. Adibide Konparatiboa:</strong>
            <p id="intro-sec3-desc">Demagun kutxa bat dugula ("x" pisu duena) eta 3 kg-ko pisu bat. Balantzan 7 kg-ko pisu baten ondoan orekatzen bada, ekuazioa hau da: <strong>x + 3 = 7</strong>. Hortaz, "x" = 4 izan behar da.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ECUACIONES DE 1er GRADO -->
    <div id="deg1" class="tab-content">
        <h2 id="deg1-title">Lehen Mailako Ekuazioak (Linealak)</h2>
        <p id="deg1-intro" style="margin-bottom: 15px;">Lehen mailako ekuazio batean, "x" ezezagunaren berretzailea 1 da. Formatu orokorra: <strong>ax + b = c</strong>.</p>
        
        <div class="interactive-builder">
            <h3 id="deg1-sim-title" style="color: var(--secondary);">Simuladore Interaktiboa (Panela eta Deslizadoreak)</h3>
            
            <div class="controls-grid">
                <div class="control-row">
                    <label id="lbl-deg1-a">Koefizientea 'a':</label>
                    <div class="control-inputs">
                        <input type="number" id="deg1-a-num" value="2" step="1" oninput="syncDeg1('a', 'num')">
                        <input type="range" id="deg1-a-range" value="2" min="-10" max="10" step="1" oninput="syncDeg1('a', 'range')">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="control-row">
                    <label id="lbl-deg1-b">Termino 'b':</label>
                    <div class="control-inputs">
                        <input type="number" id="deg1-b-num" value="4" step="1" oninput="syncDeg1('b', 'num')">
                        <input type="range" id="deg1-b-range" value="4" min="-20" max="20" step="1" oninput="syncDeg1('b', 'range')">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="control-row">
                    <label id="lbl-deg1-c">Konstantea 'c':</label>
                    <div class="control-inputs">
                        <input type="number" id="deg1-c-num" value="10" step="1" oninput="syncDeg1('c', 'num')">
                        <input type="range" id="deg1-c-range" value="10" min="-20" max="20" step="1" oninput="syncDeg1('c', 'range')">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="math-display" id="deg1-eq-display">2x + 4 = 10</div>

            <div class="resolution-steps" id="deg1-steps"></div>

            <div style="font-weight: bold; color: var(--dark); margin-top: 10px;" id="lbl-deg1-graph">Adierazpen Grafikoa Ardatz Koordenatuetan:</div>
            <div class="canvas-container">
                <canvas id="deg1Canvas" width="380" height="240"></canvas>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ECUACIONES DE 2º GRADO -->
    <div id="deg2" class="tab-content">
        <h2 id="deg2-title">Bigarren Mailako Ekuazioak (Koadratikoak)</h2>
        <p id="deg2-intro" style="margin-bottom: 15px;">Egitura orokorra: <strong>ax² + bx + c = 0</strong> (non a ≠ 0).</p>

        <div class="formula-box">
            x = (-b ± √(b² - 4ac)) / (2a)
        </div>

        <div class="interactive-builder">
            <h3 id="deg2-sim-title" style="color: var(--secondary);">Simuladorea eta Grafikoa: ax² + bx + c = 0</h3>
            
            <div class="controls-grid">
                <div class="control-row">
                    <label id="lbl-deg2-a">Koefizientea 'a':</label>
                    <div class="control-inputs">
                        <input type="number" id="deg2-a-num" value="1" step="1" oninput="syncDeg2('a', 'num')">
                        <input type="range" id="deg2-a-range" value="1" min="-5" max="5" step="1" oninput="syncDeg2('a', 'range')">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="control-row">
                    <label id="lbl-deg2-b">Koefizientea 'b':</label>
                    <div class="control-inputs">
                        <input type="number" id="deg2-b-num" value="-3" step="1" oninput="syncDeg2('b', 'num')">
                        <input type="range" id="deg2-b-range" value="-3" min="-10" max="10" step="1" oninput="syncDeg2('b', 'range')">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="control-row">
                    <label id="lbl-deg2-c">Termino 'c':</label>
                    <div class="control-inputs">
                        <input type="number" id="deg2-c-num" value="2" step="1" oninput="syncDeg2('c', 'num')">
                        <input type="range" id="deg2-c-range" value="2" min="-10" max="10" step="1" oninput="syncDeg2('c', 'range')">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="math-display" id="deg2-eq-display">1x² - 3x + 2 = 0</div>

            <div id="deg2-disc-status" class="disc-info disc-positive"></div>

            <div class="resolution-steps" id="deg2-steps"></div>

            <div style="font-weight: bold; color: var(--dark); margin-top: 10px;" id="lbl-deg2-graph">Adierazpen Grafikoa Ardatz Koordenatuetan:</div>
            <div class="canvas-container">
                <canvas id="deg2Canvas" width="380" height="240"></canvas>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- PRÁCTICA / CUESTIONARIOS -->
    <div id="practice" class="tab-content">
        <h2 id="prac-title">Ariketa Praktikoak</h2>
        <p id="prac-intro" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">Ebaztu ondorengo ekuazioak eta sartu lortutako balioak zure erantzunak egiaztatzeko.</p>

        <!-- Quiz 1er Grado -->
        <div class="quiz-box">
            <h3 id="quiz1-title">1. Ariketa: Lehen Mailako Ekuazioa</h3>
            <div class="quiz-interface">
                <span id="q1-eq-text" style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.2rem;">3x - 6 = 9</span>
                <span style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.1rem;">➔ x = </span>
                <input type="number" id="q1-ans" class="quiz-input" placeholder="x">
                <div class="btn-group">
                    <button class="btn-check" onclick="checkQuiz1()" id="btn-q1-check">Egiaztatu</button>
                    <button class="btn-random" onclick="generateQuiz1()" id="btn-q1-rand">Beste ariketa bat</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div id="q1-feedback" class="feedback"></div>
        </div>

        <!-- Quiz 2º Grado -->
        <div class="quiz-box">
            <h3 id="quiz2-title">2. Ariketa: Bigarren Mailako Ekuazioa</h3>
            <p id="quiz2-desc" style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #4a5568; margin-bottom: 10px;">Idatzi lortutako x1 eta x2 balioak (ordenak ez du garrantzirik):</p>
            <div class="quiz-interface">
                <span id="q2-eq-text" style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.2rem;">x² - 5x + 6 = 0</span>
                <span style="font-weight: bold;">➔ x₁ = </span>
                <input type="number" id="q2-ans1" class="quiz-input" placeholder="x1">
                <span style="font-weight: bold;">, x₂ = </span>
                <input type="number" id="q2-ans2" class="quiz-input" placeholder="x2">
                <div class="btn-group">
                    <button class="btn-check" onclick="checkQuiz2()" id="btn-q2-check">Egiaztatu</button>
                    <button class="btn-random" onclick="generateQuiz2()" id="btn-q2-rand">Beste ariketa bat</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div id="q2-feedback" class="feedback"></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <p id="footer-text">&copy; 2026 Matematika Baliabideak - DBH 1</p>
    </footer>
</div>

